- Maintain and update procedures;
- Work in conjunction with Underwriting department, Claims, Brokers, Agents, BCR, and Companies;
- Regularly settle and claim funds from co-insurers;
- Respond to various internal and external complaints;
- Fill in activity tracking.
What you bring:
- Accounting/Finance graduate (master degree would be a plus);
- Fluent English written and spoken;
- B2 or C1 level of French knowledge;
- Minimum 2 years experience in the Insurance/Finance/Banking/Accounting sector.
- We highly welcome candidates with a genuine interest and affinity for Information Technology (IT) and Generative Artificial Intelligence (GenAI), as these attributes are considered valuable assets to our team.
You have:
- Analytical skills
