- Knowledge of Excel and Microsoft Office tools;
- Adaptability and organizational skills;
- Ability to analyze and accuracy;
- Adherence to deadlines and procedures;
- Adaptability and ease to interact in a multi-cultural environment.
What we offer:
We support your well-being
