The Data Privacy Analyst with German provides advice on the Allianz information- and document management rules and processes, on compliance with existing data privacy processes or policies supporting the implementation of governance systems. Supports data privacy and governance activities: Implemention and tracking the execution of risk-based analysis, reporting, contribute to the effective management of data privacy tools and processes within the√Ç¬† organisation and its affiliates or local entities.
