Support the development, maintenance and implementation of√Ç¬† data privacy√Ç¬† and AI governance management data privacy system√Ç¬† in accordance with√Ç¬† applicable data privacy laws and regulations, the Allianz Privacy Standard (APS) and Binding Corporate Rules (BCRs)
